00:32:30.140 --> 00:32:33.760
So we just wanted to go
through some of the steps

00:32:33.760 --> 00:32:36.210
that we'll typically
do within a deployment.

00:32:36.210 --> 00:32:38.970
And then I'll do a demo of what
