00:53:14.550 --> 00:53:18.260
set up, and a few other things.

00:53:18.260 --> 00:53:19.730
And the last one
is administration.

00:53:19.730 --> 00:53:22.270
You would go down here
to actually update

00:53:22.270 --> 00:53:25.410
the software on it or actually
perform some maintenance

00:53:25.410 --> 00:53:27.060
