00:53:27.060 --> 00:53:31.730
One of the things under the
cluster section that we usually

00:53:31.730 --> 00:53:35.290
spend a lot of time with,
other than the tab which

00:53:35.290 --> 00:53:38.870
had FXT nodes in the dashboard,
you can drill down a little bit

00:53:38.870 --> 00:53:39.740
deeper here.

00:53:39.740 --> 00:53:42.240
Usually this will give you a
little bit more information

00:53:42.240 --> 00:53:44.031
once we have activity,
but you can actually

00:53:44.031 --> 00:53:45.100
do some activities here.

00:53:45.100 --> 00:53:48.160
I can change the
name of this node

00:53:48.160 --> 00:53:51.770
