00:54:01.474 --> 00:54:02.890
Of course, this
is not a hardware.

00:54:02.890 --> 00:54:03.973
This is a virtual machine.

00:54:03.973 --> 00:54:04.824
There's no IPA.

00:54:04.824 --> 00:54:06.240
But nonetheless,
here's the client

00:54:06.240 --> 00:54:11.487
facing IPs and other
performance information.

00:54:11.487 --> 00:54:13.820
And then at the bottom, it
