01:32:07.010 --> 01:32:10.219
JEFF KEMBER: So in terms
of a real time transcode--

01:32:10.219 --> 01:32:10.760
AUDIENCE: Yes

01:32:10.760 --> 01:32:11.760
JEFF KEMBER: --and such?

01:32:11.760 --> 01:32:14.580
Yeah, there are some
